DESCRIPTION >
    Sessions: full pageview+conversion event list for ONE specific visitor
    (explanation-modal detail read). Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id,
    timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of api/routes/sessions.js:149-166 (queryName
    'visitor_sessions'). Identity rule #19a: WHERE distinct_id = <param> is
    the canonical stitching key filter, no argMin/argMax. Typed-column
    translation (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6): properties.site_id -> site_id, event ->
    event_type, properties.page_url -> page_url, properties.utm_source ->
    utm_source, properties.utm_medium -> utm_medium, properties.utm_campaign
    -> utm_campaign, properties.conversion_value -> conversion_value (typed
    Float64 DEFAULT 0). No JSON-bag fields.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

NODE visitor_sessions_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        event_type,
        timestamp,
        page_url,
        utm_source,
        utm_medium,
        utm_campaign,
        conversion_value
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND distinct_id = {{ String(distinct_id, required=True) }}
      AND (event_type = '$pageview' OR event_type = '$conversion')
    ORDER BY timestamp ASC
    LIMIT 500

TYPE endpoint
